          "text": "|  | Traditional AR group (4 People) | Enhanced AR group (5 People) | Paper-based group (4 People) |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ST | \\* \\*61.37 % | \\* \\*67.27 % | \\* 43.18 % |\n| LT | \\* \\*54.54 % | \\* \\*74.54 % | \\* 40.91 % |\n| LT - ST | -6.83 % | 7.27 % | -2.27 % |\n| ST (short-term), | LT (long-term) |  |  |",
